      "description": "Admission Deposit | University of Dubuque Skip Navigation Apply Visit Invest Heritage Center Payments Search Toggle Search Menu Quick Links Back MyCampus Login News and Events Calendar Event Requests Academic Calendar Charles C. Myers Library Bookstore Dining Services Directory Admission & Aid Back Admission & Aid Apply Now Schedule a Visit What Sets Us Apart Request Information Costs Financial Aid Spartans Ready Prospective Students Transfer Students Former UD Students Graduate Students LIFE - Adult Accelerated Degrees Veterans Housing Application Pay Admission Deposit Campus Life Back Campus Life Apply Now Visit Us Student Services & Resources Student Involvement Residence Life Student Guidelines Career Services News & Events Office of Technology Smeltzer-Kelly Student Health Center Campus Ministry Wendt Center Office of Student Life Safety and Security Academics Back Academics Apply Now MyUD LOGIN Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs UD Global / LIFE HyFlex Programs Theological Seminary Programs Academic Advising Academic Calendars Academic Success Center TRIO/SSS Library Office of the Registrar Special Learning Opportunities Office of Academic Affairs Seminary Back Seminary Apply Now About UDTS Schedule a Visit Academic Programs Special Programs Choosing a Program Faculty and Staff Lectures & Events Outreach & Connections Financial Aid Connect with Us Athletics Back Athletics Athletic Calendar Athletics Staff Directory Recreation Facilities Student Athlete Handbook Alumni & Investors Back Alumni & Investors Invest Now Update My Information The Momentum Campaign Alumni Events & Activities Alumni Awards & Recognition Giving to UD Impact Stories Alumni Perks & Benefits Alumni: Campus Visit UD News & Events Athletic Events Heritage Center Stay Connected Apply Visit Invest Heritage Center Payments Admission Deposit The Admission Deposit is non-refundable. Please consider all the information that you need before paying your Admission Deposit. This represents your commitment to attend the University of Dubuque. We will begin to make plans for your attendance following receipt of your Admission Deposit. Only one of the deposits below needs to be paid depending on the program of study. Aviation (Flight Operations) students must pay a $400 Aviation Admission Deposit in order to secure a place in the Aviation Program, their place in the class, and residence hall (if living on campus). All other students are required to pay the $200 Admission Deposit to reserve their place in the class and residence hall (if living on campus). Admission Deposit Aviation Admission Deposit 2000 University Ave. Dubuque IA, 52001 563.589.3000 Directory Safety & Security Reporting Hotline About UD Careers Jeanne Clery Act Title IX Map & Directions Apply My Campus Login Copyright 2021 University of Dubuque. All rights reserved. HEERF Reports Privacy Statement Accessibility Consumer Information Contact Facebook Instagram Twitter You Tube LinkedIn"
